messages.pt:
Grande escultor de {Color:Blue}
estatuetas{Color:White} de barro do
Clube Minitendo.

Também colecciona {Color:Blue}
Conchas Misteriosas{Color:White}.

{Sound:00:8D}OU detenemos agora a {Color:Green}
Vaati{Color:White} ou habremos
perdido à {Color:Green}princesa Zeda{Color:White}

e Hyrule para sempre!
{Player}, não pode perder!

{Sound:00:8D}Não te ponha nervioso,
{Player}! {Color:Blue}Apenas há uno de
verdade.{Color:White}

messages.en:
{04:10:00}Hmn?! Hmmmmnnnn...
Ah, of course! How silly of me!{Sound:00:92}
Hey, my boy! {Color:Blue}Jump into that whirlwind{Color:White}
over there for me!
Heh heh heh... I wonder, is this a
great idea or a terrible one?

messages.es_ref:
Agarra algo pulsando el Botón {Key:Right}
y después pulsa {Key:Dpad} para {Color:Blue}tirar o
empujar{Color:White}. No lo olvides.

{Sound:00:92}¡Oh! {Color:Blue}¡Rayos de sol!{Color:White}

Qué calorcito hace ahora...
Parece que recupero las fuerzas.

{Sound:00:8E}Qué cantidad de libros..., y todos
parecen tan interesantes... A ver...
{Color:Blue}"Cómo ganar 100 rupias en diez días"{Symbol:16}
"¡Es un niño!", de "Mamá"{Symbol:16} 
"A veces me emociono", de Poemun{Symbol:16}
e "Historias de Lem para noches de
insomnio"{Color:White}. Todos podrían estar bien.
Échales un ojo.

{Sound:00:8E}El {Color:Green}minish con gafas{Color:White}...
¿Cómo se llamaba? ¿"Fistro"?
¿"Fusta"? ¡Festa! ¡Eso es!

Dijo que encontraríamos el {Color:Red}frutabel{Color:White}
en la {Color:Blue}casa que tiene forma de barril{Color:White}
y está al sur de su casa.

messages.pt:
{Sound:00:8E}Se quer reforjar a {Color:Red}
espada sagrada{Color:White}, faça o
que te disse o sabio {Color:Green}

ancião Minish{Color:White}. Tem que
procurar o {Color:Red}Elemento da
Terra{Color:White}.

{Sound:00:8E}Por certo, o sabio {Color:Green}
ancião do floresta{Color:White}
disse que volvieses a

ver isso em quanto
tuvieses o {Color:Red}Elemento da
Terra{Color:White}.

messages.en:
{Sound:00:91}Aww...{01:0A}

{01:01}I guess the festival that was going on
here in town has already ended.
I really wanted to see that...{01:0A}

{Sound:00:92}It must have looked quite different
when the festival was going on, hm?

{Sound:00:92}Oh, don't tell me you've forgotten
already! What is WRONG with you?
The Minish elder told us to see {Color:Green}Melari{Color:White}
up on {Color:Green}Mount Crenel{Color:White}.
{Sound:00:90}But how do you suppose we're going to
climb that pile of rocks, anyway?{01:0A}

{Sound:00:8E}Hmmm...{01:0A}

{01:01}If the mountain is anything like those
woods, there will be monsters ahead.
{Sound:00:90}I'm not really busting a seam to see
this {Color:Green}Melari{Color:White}, but...we have no choice.{01:0A}

messages.es_ref:
{Sound:00:8D}¿Qué pasa? ¡No hay tiempo que perder!
¡Debemos dar con el próximo {Color:Red}elemento{Color:White}
mientras {Color:Green}Melta{Color:White} reforja la {Color:Red}espada{Color:White}!

messages.pt:
{Sound:00:8D}Que acontece? Não há
tempo que perder!
Devemos dar com o

próximo {Color:Red}elemento{Color:White}
mientras {Color:Green}Melari{Color:White}
reforja a {Color:Red}espada{Color:White}!

{Sound:00:92}Bom, volvamos com {Color:Green}
Melari{Color:White}. Certeza que já
tem pronta a {Color:Red}espada{Color:White}.

messages.en:
{Sound:00:8E}We must find the {Color:Green}elemental sanctuary{Color:White}
to fill the sword with elemental power.
I'd never have looked for the {Color:Green}elemental
sanctuary{Color:White} in {Color:Green}Hyrule Castle{Color:White}, though!{01:0A}
{01:01}You know how to get there, right?
Let's go!

{Sound:00:8D}So! We must infuse the {Color:Red}White Sword{Color:White}
with the {Color:Red}elemental power{Color:White}.{01:0A}
{01:01}That means we must find the
{Color:Green}elemental sanctuary{Color:White}.
And the way we do that is... Um...
Well, I'm sure we'll figure it out!

messages.pt:
{Sound:00:92}Quando otorguemos o
poder dos dois {Color:Red}
elementos{Color:White} à {Color:Red}espada{Color:White},

estaremos a meio
caminho de conseguir a {Color:Red}
espada sagrada{Color:White}.

messages.en:
{Sound:00:8E}Hrm... According to the map, we'll need
to cross {Color:Green}Castor Wilds{Color:White}.{01:0A}
That unexplored region is where we
must go to find the next {Color:Red}element{Color:White}!{01:01}

{Sound:00:90}Hnyaaaawn...{01:0A}

{01:01}Mmmmnumumummm...
Even I'm getting tired now...{01:0A}
I guess I need a {Color:Red}wake-up mushroom{Color:White}
or something to perk me up!

messages.pt:
{Sound:00:91}Há que ver o que estamos
passando para
conseguir o seguinte {Color:Red}

elemento{Color:White}... Não
podemos nos rendir! {Sound:00:92}
Levanta o ánimo, {Player}!

messages.en:
{Sound:00:92}I just can't figure out how {Color:Green}Librari{Color:White}
got into the {Color:Green}Temple of Droplets{Color:White}.
I'm going crazy with curiosity!

messages.es_ref:
{Sound:00:92}¿Cómo llegaría el {Color:Green}anciano Librari{Color:White}
hasta el {Color:Green}templo de las aguas{Color:White}?
No puedo dejar de darle vueltas...

messages.pt:
{Sound:00:8E}Não nos fique mais
remedio que ir até o
lugar marcado no {Color:Red}

mapa{Color:White}... Não há outra
forma de conseguir o {Color:Red}
elemento{Color:White} que nos falta.

{Sound:00:92}Está claro que fala do {Color:Green}
origen de uma corriente
de água{Color:White}. Do punto onde

começa a correr. Mas {Color:Blue}
onde será{Color:White}?

messages.es_ref:
{Sound:00:8D}¡Este lugar es muy peligroso! {Player},
tienes que llevar a la {Color:Green}princesa Zelda{Color:White}
hasta el {Color:Green}santuario{Color:White}.

messages.pt:
{Sound:00:8E}A Força escura de {Color:Green}Vaati{Color:White}
tem chegado até o
último rincão! {Sound:00:92}{Player}! {Color:Green}

Princesa Zelda{Color:White}! Mirad
onde pisáis!

{Sound:00:8E}Me tem llamado, {Player}? {Sound:01:E4}
Que quer? Ai, ai, ai... {Color:Blue}
Me tenho mordido a

lengua{Color:White}! {Sound:00:91}Já não posso
falar... Búscate a
vida.
